cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this survey, its reading grid or its analysis scripts, please cite it as below."
title: "Reinforcement Learning: Did We Listen to Joelle Pineau in 2018?"
abstract: >-
  A survey of papers and a set of experiments that measure, flaw by flaw, what has changed in deep
  reinforcement learning since Joelle Pineau's 2018 talks on reproducibility. French title: « Apprentissage
  par renforcement : A-t-on écouté Joelle Pineau en 2018 ? ». The repository recomputes every number and
  every figure of the document from the committed results.
type: software
